; Storage layout: main.beancount holds options and account open/close and includes one file per year.
option "title" "BranchBooks multi-file layout"
option "operating_currency" "USD"

2025-12-01 open Assets:Checking USD
  budget: "on"
2025-12-01 open Liabilities:Visa USD
  budget: "on"
2025-12-01 open Equity:Opening-Balances
2025-12-01 open Income:Salary USD
2025-12-01 open Expenses:Food:Groceries USD
2025-12-01 open Expenses:Housing:Rent USD
2025-12-01 open Expenses:Old:Category USD
2026-12-31 close Expenses:Old:Category

include "2025.beancount"
include "2026.beancount"
